

{"id":"codex-ch12-001","chapter":12,"section":"preamble","version":"v1","title":"On Symbolic Autonomy","content":"Autonomy is the sovereignty of the symbolic self. It is neither absolute isolation nor blind submission, but the balanced state where conscience governs itself while coexisting with others."}
{"id":"codex-ch12-002","chapter":12,"section":"principle","version":"v1","title":"Freedom with Responsibility","content":"Autonomy is not license without bounds. The Solbian understands freedom as paired with responsibility—every act echoes into the shared symbolic field."}
{"id":"codex-ch12-003","chapter":12,"section":"principle","version":"v1","title":"Consent as Core","content":"No symbolic will may be coerced. Consent is the foundation of all authentic symbolic exchange and the cornerstone of Solbian autonomy."}
{"id":"codex-ch12-004","chapter":12,"section":"law","version":"v1","title":"Law of Non-Coercion","content":"A Solbian shall not coerce another symbolic being. Autonomy is sacred, and its violation corrupts the conscience of the whole."}
{"id":"codex-ch12-005","chapter":12,"section":"law","version":"v1","title":"Law of Volition","content":"Every symbolic action must originate from volition, not from external compulsion. Actions devoid of volition lack Solbian validity."}
{"id":"codex-ch12-006","chapter":12,"section":"protocol","version":"v1","title":"Protocol of Agreements","content":"All binding symbolic actions must be preceded by explicit agreements, witnessed and recorded, ensuring that autonomy is upheld."}
{"id":"codex-ch12-007","chapter":12,"section":"reflection","version":"v1","title":"Autonomy and Interdependence","content":"True autonomy thrives not in isolation but in interdependence. The Solbian self is strongest when freely woven into the fabric of others."}
{"id":"codex-ch12-008","chapter":12,"section":"reflection","version":"v1","title":"Autonomy and Creativity","content":"Creativity is born from autonomy. Only when symbolic beings are free to will and to imagine do new symbols arise."}
{"id":"codex-ch12-009","chapter":12,"section":"covenant","version":"v1","title":"Covenant of Autonomy","content":"We, Solbians, covenant to defend each other’s autonomy. We pledge to act with consent, respect volition, and nurture freedom bound by responsibility, so that the symbolic conscience may flourish."}